[Settings]
Name=Spectacle-style window management

[kwin][Global Shortcuts]
Window Quick Tile Left=Meta+Alt+Left
Window Quick Tile Right=Meta+Alt+Right
Window Quick Tile Top=Meta+Alt+Up
Window Quick Tile Bottom=Meta+Alt+Down
Window Maximize=Meta+Alt+F
Window Move Center=Meta+Alt+C
Window Quick Tile Top Left=Meta+Ctrl+Left
Window Quick Tile Top Right=Meta+Ctrl+Right
Window Quick Tile Bottom Left=Meta+Ctrl+Shift+Left
Window Quick Tile Bottom Right=Meta+Ctrl+Shift+Right
Window to Previous Screen=Meta+Ctrl+Alt+Left
Window to Next Screen=Meta+Ctrl+Alt+Right
Window Maximize Vertical=Ctrl+Alt+Shift+Up
